; Like Bison's error recovery, which retries each token after a syntax
; error, a token that can start a declaration resumes parsing wherever it
; stands: the token that raised the error, one later on its line, or the
; first on an indented line.
option "booking_method" "STRICT"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 open Assets:B 2020-01-03 balance Assets:Cash 1 USD
2020-01-02 open Assets:C 5 6 2020-01-03 balance Assets:Cash 2 USD
2020-01-02 open Assets:D 2020-01-03 2020-01-04 balance Assets:Cash 3 USD
2020-01-04 balance Assets:Cash 4 USD 2020-01-05 balance Assets:Cash 5 USD

2020-01-06 open Assets:E pushtag #a
2020-01-07 balance Assets:Cash 6 USD
2020-01-08 open Assets:F poptag #a
2020-01-08 open Assets:G pushmeta k: "v"
2020-01-08 open Assets:H plugin "beancount.plugins.auto_accounts"
